 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></button></div></div></h2><p>Like Ge=
mma 3, Gemma 4 interleaves layers of local attention (also called =E2=80=9C=
sliding window attention=E2=80=9D) with global attention (which is regular =
or =E2=80=9Cfull=E2=80=9D attention).</p><p>Remember that in global attenti=
on, every token attends to all tokens that came before it. Sliding window a=
ttention, however, only attends to tokens within a certain limit. This sign=
ificantly reduces the compute needed to calculate the full attention.</p><d=
