div></h2><p>Interleaving local attention with global attention is an intere=
sting way of making a Large Language Model more efficient. However, it is n=
ot a free lunch. The global attention layers still attend to the entire con=
text, which is a costly and slow process.</p><p>In this section, we explore=
 various tricks that Gemma 4 uses to make those global attention layers mor=
e efficient!</p><h3 class=3D"header-anchor-post">Grouped Query Attention<di=
