tokens that the model hadn=E2=80=99t seen before. The space of all possible=
 RoPE rotations is quite large with global attention versus local attention=
 and by limiting the number of rotations, the model can do a much better jo=
b of handling a large context.</p><p><span>When we put everything together,=
