07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></button></div></div></h2><p>A big component of =
the Gemma 4 releases are their multimodal capabilities. All variants suppor=
t image inputs and allow for handling variable aspect ratios and resolution=
s!</p><p>What makes this possible is a Vision Encoder based on the Vision T=
ransformer (ViT) to process the images. A ViT works similarly to a regular =
Large Language Model and instead of tokenizing text into sequences of words=
, it splits up the input image into sequences of patches. Each patch (a sub=
set of the input image) is then passed a Transformer model which spits out =
an embedding per patch.</p><div class=3D"captioned-image-container"><figure=
