igure></div><p>Although the visual shows a single expert, most MoE activate=
 at least several and combine the result. In Gemma 4, the MoE variant has 1=
28 experts that the router can choose from and 8 will be activated at a tim=
e.</p><p><span>Moreover, there is a </span><strong>shared expert</strong><s=
pan>. This expert will always be activated and used to process the input em=
