a lot of general knowledge that should always be activated, whereas the sel=
ected experts contain more fine-grained knowledge. In Gemma 4, this shared =
expert is three times the size to make sure it encompasses the necessary ge=
neral knowledge.</span></p><div class=3D"captioned-image-container"><figure=
